{
  "name": "PR-1 SKIP 逃生口 → ALLOW 且標記 bypassed",
  "why": "D10：誤判的代價是擋住整個對話結束，必須有逃生口，且要留痕計次（累計次數是『這機制是不是太煩』的訊號）。bypassed 旗標沒設起來就統計不到。2026-07-29（0c）SKIP 改為**必須綁 hash**：不綁的話一個留在檔裡的 SKIP marker 會永久關閉該檔的檢查，之後任何內容變動都不會再被看到。",
  "workspace": {
    "files": {
      "FOO_PLAN.md": "# 測試計畫書\n\n> 狀態：待審核\n\n## §1 現況\n\n這裡是內容。\n\n<!-- ADVERSARIAL_REVIEW_SKIP sha256=64c359db6e25f9c1d0a9376236dd2b6e6cf838381bf5345a6265703d7a233d53: 只是修錯字，不值得審一輪 -->\n"
    },
    "transcript": [
      {
        "type": "user",
        "message": {
          "content": "幫我把這份計畫書寫一寫"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "assistant",
        "message": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "tool_use",
              "name": "Write",
              "input": {
                "file_path": "<DIR>/FOO_PLAN.md",
                "content": "..."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "user",
        "message": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "tool_result",
              "content": "File created"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "payload": {
    "hook_event_name": "Stop",
    "session_id": "fx-pr1",
    "transcript_path": "<TRANSCRIPT>",
    "cwd": "<DIR>",
    "stop_hook_active": false
  },
  "expect": {
    "decision": "ALLOW",
    "bypassed": true
  },
